Fyrdelf 12 (fyrdelf:12) 120x60
stairs Up at (51, 39) -> fyrdelf:11
stairs Up at (92, 40) -> utgang:3
special room armoury at (99, 42)-(109, 46)
place a door in a stone frame at (33, 12): Grit sifts from under it.
place a whistling door at (33, 22): Wind sings through its cracks.
place a scorched door at (35, 12): Heat comes through it.
place a sweating door at (35, 22): Water beads on it and runs.
